as, as much as we can,

00:10:23.995 --> 00:10:25.795
which is still, you know, not that much

00:10:25.795 --> 00:10:28.415
because again, it's
entrepreneurship is hard,

00:10:28.415 --> 00:10:29.795
but we think we can make your likelihood

00:10:29.795 --> 00:10:31.935
to success a little bit easier.

00:10:31.935 --> 00:10:34.755
And again, if you're reselling
someone else's products

00:10:34.755 --> 00:10:37.335
or you're a drop shipper
or you are a creator

00:10:37.335 --> 00:10:40.015
and you're, you don't, you're
not making very many things.

00:10:40.015 --> 00:10:43.155
You know, that additional 20
basis points or 10 basis points

00:10:43.155 --> 00:10:46.185
or 40 basis points on credit
card processing rates,

00:10:46.185 --> 00:10:47.435
that makes a big difference.

00:10:47.435 --> 00:10:50.115
Yeah. Or your ability to get
shipping labels from, you know,

00:10:50.115 --> 00:10:53.035
any of the big shipping
companies at the same rate,

00:10:53.035 --> 00:10:55.495
at the same price that 10 years ago,

00:10:55.495 --> 00:10:57.285
the biggest companies on
the planet were getting

00:10:57.285 --> 00:10:58.675
that makes a difference too.

00:10:58.675 --> 00:11:00.215
So that's part of the
sort of community side.

00:11:00.215 --> 00:11:01.255
The other part of the
community side is just

00:11:02.335 --> 00:11:05.655
entrepreneurship can be a lonely endeavor.

00:11:05.655 --> 00:11:08.845
It's not, you know, you, you
