00:11:21.545 --> 00:11:23.285
whether it's on Facebook or it's on,

00:11:23.285 --> 00:11:24.845
you know, Twitter, Instagram.

00:11:24.845 --> 00:11:26.745
We try to facilitate more of

00:11:26.745 --> 00:11:28.785
that community feel even though everyone's

00:11:28.785 --> 00:11:30.245
running their own independent business.

00:11:30.245 --> 00:11:33.905
And I think the cool part about
running a business in 2022

00:11:33.905 --> 00:11:37.965
relative to, you know, 1922

00:11:37.965 --> 00:11:42.185
or 1822 for that matter, is
there was a sense in, in, in

00:11:42.185 --> 00:11:44.225
previous generations of entrepreneurs

00:11:45.195 --> 00:11:46.635
that things were zero sum.

00:11:46.635 --> 00:11:48.885
Meaning if you made
more, someone made less.

00:11:49.865 --> 00:11:50.965
And that often was

00:11:50.965 --> 00:11:52.845
because if you were in
a physical, you know,

00:11:52.845 --> 00:11:55.625
let's say you were in a town
square a hundred years ago

00:11:55.625 --> 00:11:57.185
and there was a baker there

00:11:57.185 --> 00:11:58.565
and you open up a bakery,

00:11:59.995 --> 00:12:02.965
there's the total adjustable
market of that, of that for

00:12:02.965 --> 00:12:04.835
that bakery is, is is pretty clear.

00:12:04.835 --> 00:12:05.925
It's the people that live there that

00:12:05.925 --> 00:12:07.305
want to buy bread who can afford bread.

00:12:07.305 --> 00:12:08.645
So if you open a, a bakery

00:12:08.645 --> 00:12:10.065
and there's another
bakery than the street,

00:12:10.065 --> 00:12:11.405
you may make more money and

00:12:11.405 --> 00:12:13.225
that other baker makes less money.

00:12:13.225 --> 00:12:15.385
But that's not the way
modern business works.

00:12:15.385 --> 00:12:20.385
Modern business is fundamentally
positive sum meaning

00:12:20.385 --> 00:12:23.585
you may find a niche or a
geography or a demographic

00:12:23.585 --> 00:12:25.035
or a community that, that

00:12:25.035 --> 00:12:27.565
that other baker never even encountered

00:12:27.565 --> 00:12:29.105
because it wasn't obvious.

00:12:29.105 --> 00:12:32.665
So maybe your bakery in the,
on the internet, which has,

00:12:32.665 --> 00:12:34.365
you know, effectively
a total pop, you know,

00:12:34.365 --> 00:12:35.765
total addressable market of anyone

00:12:35.765 --> 00:12:37.325
